Docs by Kabeer's Network (kabeers.network)
Service available for free at https://docs.kabeers.network
------------------------------------------------------------

This directory contains the Next.js 15 web application
for Kabeer's Docs. The client provides real-time document
collaboration with rich editing capabilities.

BUILDING
--------
- Install Bun runtime (https://bun.sh)
- Run: bun install
- For development: bun dev (runs on port 4321)
- For production: bun run build

DEPLOYMENT
----------
- Built with Next.js 15 using App Router
- Deploy to Vercel for optimal performance
- Alternative: Netlify, or self-hosted Node.js
- Set environment vars in .env.production

ARCHITECTURE
------------
- Next.js 15 with Turbopack (dev)
- React 19 with TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS 4 for styling
- TipTap + YJS for real-time editing
- Hocuspocus for WebSocket sync
- Nanostores for state management
- Radix UI for accessible components

PATTERNS
--------
- Client-side collaboration via Yjs
- Server Actions for mutations
- App Router with nested layouts
- Component-based architecture

CLOUDSTORE
----------
- Data persistence via Kabeer's Cloudstore
- API integration at /src/services/api
- Real-time sync through WebSocket
- https://github.com/Kabeers-Network/cloudstore

